===Etymology===
From old forms {{m|en|Troyan}}, {{m|en|Troian}}, {{inh|en|enm|Troian|Troiā̆n}}, from {{inh|en|ang|Trōiān}}, from {{der|en|la|Troiānus}}, from {{suffix|la|Troia|ānus|t1=Troy|nocat=1}}, from {{der|en|grc|Τροίᾱ}}.

